%% Finding state machine. verification_status is a separate field set by the rescan mode.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> new: first detection
    new --> open: triaged
    open --> assigned: owner set
    assigned --> fixed_claimed: owner reports a fix
    fixed_claimed --> verified_closed: rescan passes
    fixed_claimed --> reopened: rescan still fails
    verified_closed --> reopened: issue returns
    reopened --> assigned: owner set again
    verified_closed --> [*]
    note right of verified_closed
        emulator or fixture rescan: verified
        live rescan: observed_unverified
        no rescan: not_verified
    end note
